-No.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.529 line:92%
I just -- I'm really high.

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:31.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I'm really [Bleep] hig
right now.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:35.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know what I'm doing.
I think you should go.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:38.038
-But a second ago, you wer
