00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:44.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm a nice guy.
-Are you?

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.846 size:88% position:44%
-Please welcome back to
the show Carey Mulligan.

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:49.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
How are you, Carey?
-I'm good, thanks.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:50.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
How are you?
-I'm good.

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:53.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
This movie -- that clip
really gets across.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
This movie has
an excellent score.

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:59.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's one of the many thing
I loved about it.

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:00.860 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Very dramatic.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:03.063 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of scenes
with great tension.

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:06.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you happy with
how this film turned out?

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:09.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. I mean, I'm so --
I'm so proud

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:11.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
just to have been in it,
to get to witness

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:13.907 size:84% position:42%
what Emerald Fennell,
our director, has done.

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:17.110
She's just a genius -- a sort of
mad genius, but a genius.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:22.148
-It seems like she knew exactl
the movie she wanted to make

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:25.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
You were obviously involve
early as an executive producer

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:28.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
Were there a lot of
conversations about tone,

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:31.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
or did she know exactly the wa
she wanted to present it

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:34.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
from the beginning?
-I think it was --

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:35.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think the film
was in her head.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:38.898
I think she had -- I mean,
when I signed on to the film

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:41.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the same moment that sh
sent me the script,

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:44.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
