the movie finished.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.142 size:78% position:39%
And there was a test,
an audience there,

00:04:36.142 --> 00:04:39.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
to sort of give it an audience
And Emerald was sitting

00:04:39.078 --> 00:04:40.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
