00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:59.866
And Emerald was sort of
creeping, melting into her seat.

00:04:59.866 --> 00:05:03.503
But, luckily, I missed it.
-Those were simpler times,

00:05:03.503 --> 00:05:06.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
