what was happening in movies

00:05:06.839 --> 00:05:08.908 line:92%
[ Chuckling ] I miss those days.

00:05:08.908 --> 00:05:10.243 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I miss that, too.

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:13.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Last we talked,
you were telling us

00:05:13.246 --> 00:05:15.481 line:92%
how you guys live on a far

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:17.817 size:75% position:38%
that is often muddy,
often a little wet.

00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:20.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think that one thing
people have had to deal with

00:05:20.486 --> 00:05:24.791 size:88% position:44%
