from home is slow Wi-Fi.

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:25.658 size:88% position:44% line:92%
How is the farm's Wi-Fi?

00:05:25.658 --> 00:05:28.594 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because you're coming across
crystal clear for us now.

00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:31.431 line:92%
-It's taken a lot of work.

00:05:31.431 --> 00:05:34.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's been my main project
for 2020,

00:05:34.167 --> 00:05:35.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I had
nothing else to do,

00:05:35.401 --> 00:05:38.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
