for upgrading your Wi-Fi.

00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:54.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
Congrats on the film.
It is really something special

00:05:54.253 --> 00:05:55.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
And thanks so much
for being here.

00:05:55.555 --> 00:05:58.257 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
Thanks for having me.

